{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"pp-bank-economies-diseconomies-of-scale","kind":"bank","title":{"en":[{"text":"Economies & Diseconomies of Scale"}],"zh":[{"text":"規模經濟與規模不經濟"}]},"instructions":{"en":[],"zh":[]},"fonts":{"latin":"Times New Roman","eastAsia":"PMingLiU"},"pageSetup":{"paper":"A4","orientation":"portrait","margins":{"top":1296,"right":1296,"bottom":1440,"left":1296}},"header":{"enabled":false,"rule":false,"showOnFirstPage":true,"bands":[]},"footer":{"enabled":false,"rule":false,"showOnFirstPage":true,"bands":[]},"questions":[{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q20","type":"mcq","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q20-s-1","text":{"en":[{"text":"The Urban Council and Regional Council are responsible for growing young trees for planting around Hong Kong. Each nursery is usually large in size. Furthermore, a large number of the same kind of young trees are planted in the same area of the nursery. This type of nursery has the following advantages:"}],"zh":[{"text":"市政局及區域市政局負責為香港周圍種植的花草樹木培植幼苗。幼苗園通常佔地廣闊，而且在同一地點上大量種植同類型的幼苗。這種幼苗園有什麼好處？"}]}}],"marks":1,"options":[{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q20-a","text":{"en":[{"text":"(1) and (2) only"}],"zh":[{"text":"只有(1)、(2)"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q20-b","text":{"en":[{"text":"(1) and (3) only"}],"zh":[{"text":"只有(1)、(3)"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q20-c","text":{"en":[{"text":"(2) and (3) only"}],"zh":[{"text":"只有(2)、(3)"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q20-d","text":{"en":[{"text":"(1),(2) and (3)"}],"zh":[{"text":"(1)、(2)、(3)"}]}}],"answerIndex":3,"statements":[{"en":[{"text":"economy of scale on irrigation facilities"}],"zh":[{"text":"灌溉系統方面享有規模經濟"}]},{"en":[{"text":"economy of scale by caring for plants of the same kind"}],"zh":[{"text":"護理同類幼苗方面享有規模經濟"}]},{"en":[{"text":"economy of scale in purchasing fertilizers"}],"zh":[{"text":"購買肥料方面享有規模經濟"}]}],"tags":["B.costs","CE1992/P2/Q20"],"provenance":{"en":[{"text":"HKCEE 1992 Paper 2 Q20"}],"zh":[{"text":"香港中學會考 1992 卷二 第 20 題"}]},"lineage":{"rootId":"pp:CE1992/P2/Q20"}},{"id":"pp-CE1994_P2_Q22","type":"mcq","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","id":"pp-CE1994_P2_Q22-s-1","text":{"en":[{"text":"A producer increase all his input to double the output. He finds that the total production cost increase by 80%. This can be explained by"}],"zh":[{"text":"一生產者增加所有投入量使產出作雙倍增加。總生產成本則增加 80%。這可用______來解釋。"}]}}],"marks":1,"options":[{"id":"pp-CE1994_P2_Q22-a","text":{"en":[{"text":"the law of supply."}],"zh":[{"text":"供應定律"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1994_P2_Q22-b","text":{"en":[{"text":"The law of diminishing returns."}],"zh":[{"text":"報酬遞減定律"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1994_P2_Q22-c","text":{"en":[{"text":"Economies of scale."}],"zh":[{"text":"規模經濟"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1994_P2_Q22-d","text":{"en":[{"text":"Diseconomies of scale."}],"zh":[{"text":"規模不經濟"}]}}],"answerIndex":2,"tags":["B.costs","CE1994/P2/Q22"],"provenance":{"en":[{"text":"HKCEE 1994 Paper 2 Q22"}],"zh":[{"text":"香港中學會考 1994 卷二 第 22 題"}]},"lineage":{"rootId":"pp:CE1994/P2/Q22"}},{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q22","type":"mcq","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q22-s-1","text":{"en":[{"text":"Which of the following about economies of scale is true?"}],"zh":[{"text":"下列哪一項關於規模經濟的描述是正確的？"}]}}],"marks":1,"options":[{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q22-a","text":{"en":[{"text":"It applies to short-run as well as long-run production."}],"zh":[{"text":"它適用於短期及長期生產。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q22-b","text":{"en":[{"text":"It will lead to a decrease in the average cost of production when the output increases."}],"zh":[{"text":"當產出增加時，它使平均成本下降。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q22-c","text":{"en":[{"text":"It occurs only when the scale of production is sufficiently large."}],"zh":[{"text":"只有當生產規模夠大時，它才出現。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q22-d","text":{"en":[{"text":"It will lead to a decrease in the total cost of production when the output increases."}],"zh":[{"text":"當產出增加時，它使總成本下降。"}]}}],"answerIndex":1,"tags":["B.costs","CE1995/P2/Q22"],"provenance":{"en":[{"text":"HKCEE 1995 Paper 2 Q22"}],"zh":[{"text":"香港中學會考 1995 卷二 第 22 題"}]},"lineage":{"rootId":"pp:CE1995/P2/Q22